flowchart LR
  raw[Raw ApacheJIT CSV] --> load[src/data.py]
  load --> split[src/split.py]
  split --> train[src/train.py]
  train --> artifact[Saved joblib pipeline]
  artifact --> infer[src/predict.py]
  infer --> ui[Streamlit app.py]
